Package: eatTechReport
Type: Package
Title: Generate Technical Reports for Educational Assessments
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Karoline A.", "Sachse",
        email = "karoline.sachse@iqb.hu-berlin.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6688-1267")),
    person("Kilian-Kristoph", "Schumann", role = "aut",
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9502-6083")))
Description: Validate and summarise test designs, sample characteristics, valid
    item-response counts, plausible values, and main-test selections and modules
    for VERA-3 assessments. Present supplied item statistics and scale
    transformations, plot performance and item distributions, and assemble
    editable Quarto sections into Word documents using the bundled
    corporate template. Synthetic examples support development without access
    to assessment data.
